<title>POLAND: NBP CLEARS LG PETRO BANK NEW CHIEF.</title>
<headline>NBP CLEARS LG PETRO BANK NEW CHIEF.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP), the central bank, has no objections to Don-Chang Park becoming president of LG Petro Bank SA, LG Petro Bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Dong-Chang Park is currently acting president of the bank, in which South Korea's LG Group controls 54.5 percent.</p>
